 <h3>1.2. Calculate enrichment for the gene signatures (AUC)</h3>
 <p>To determine whether the gene set is enriched at the top of the gene-ranking for each cell, AUCell uses the “Area Under the Curve” (AUC) of the recovery curve.</p>
-<p><img src="data:image/png;base64," width="100%" /></p>
